				<description>&lt;aside class=&#34;takeaways&#34;&gt;&#xA;  &lt;p class=&#34;takeaways-h&#34;&gt;The 30-second verdict&lt;/p&gt;&#xA;  &lt;ul&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Each block is heavy enough to hold a run of hardbound books without sliding.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Felt base protects the shelf and adds grip.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Natural Carrara veining — every pair is one of a kind.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;li&gt;Beveled edges so they don&amp;rsquo;t chip a desk or each other.&lt;/li&gt;&#xA;&lt;/ul&gt;&#xA;&#xA;  &#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;btn btn-primary&#34; href=&#34;https://www.amazon.com/s?k=solid&amp;#43;Carrara&amp;#43;white&amp;#43;marble&amp;#43;bookends&amp;#43;heavy&amp;amp;tag=csuitnec-20&amp;amp;linkCode=ll2&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;sponsored nofollow noopener&#34; data-affiliate=&#34;Solid Carrara Marble Bookends&#34; data-cta=&#34;takeaways&#34;&gt;Check Price on Amazon&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;  &lt;a class=&#34;takeaways-jump&#34; href=&#34;#full-review&#34;&gt;Or read the full breakdown ↓&lt;/a&gt;&#xA;  &#xA;&lt;/aside&gt;&#xA;&#xA;&lt;h2 id=&#34;light-bookends-dont-work&#34;&gt;Light bookends don&amp;rsquo;t work&lt;/h2&gt;&#xA;&lt;p&gt;A hollow metal L-bracket slides the moment you pull a book. Solid marble at 5+ pounds a side simply doesn&amp;rsquo;t move. If your shelf of reports and manuals is permanently leaning, &lt;a href=&#34;https://www.amazon.com/s?k=solid&amp;#43;Carrara&amp;#43;white&amp;#43;marble&amp;#43;bookends&amp;#43;heavy&amp;amp;tag=csuitnec-20&amp;amp;linkCode=ll2&#34; class=&#34;out aff&#34; target=&#34;_blank&#34; rel=&#34;sponsored nofollow noopener&#34; data-affiliate=&#34;Solid Carrara Marble Bookends&#34; data-cta=&#34;in-content&#34;&gt;check the Amazon price&lt;svg class=&#34;out-ico&#34; width=&#34;12&#34; height=&#34;12&#34; viewBox=&#34;0 0 24 24&#34; aria-hidden=&#34;true&#34;&gt;&lt;path d=&#34;M7 17 17 7M9 7h8v8&#34; fill=&#34;none&#34; stroke=&#34;currentColor&#34; stroke-width=&#34;2.5&#34; stroke-linecap=&#34;round&#34; stroke-linejoin=&#34;round&#34;/&gt;&lt;/svg&gt;&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;/p&gt;</description>
